<title>USA: CCC buys 6,360 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat for Tunisia.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 6,360 tonnes U.S. HRW wheat for Tunisia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 6,360 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for donation to Tunisia.</p>
<p>The shipment period was slated for August 10-August 31.</p>
<p>The wheat was bought from Cargill Inc, Minneapolis, at $145.57 a tonne, FOB, the CCC said.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
